#4471 contains reports with twelve distinct normalized subjects. The accepted triage rule
defines duplicates by lowercasing the subject and stripping punctuation, so this page records
one ticket for each subject group. The table computes the counts from unique report IDs in the
export rather than repeating totals by hand.

